{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0264_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2f2ee4588e177ac97de82bc3a2d91f6e9351b2556e1133a827a86c9dea983c3e", "ja": "（ドラマのロケで、温泉旅館に来ている。\nかなりの長丁場だけど、麗花は大丈夫かな？）", "zh": "（正在温泉旅馆进行电视剧的外景拍摄。虽然拍摄时间相当长，但丽花没问题吧？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0264_1001_048rei", "source_sha256": "8d6627ab4b02dfeb1f62f5646643a6b43c445822b74634e3800f57cf0c3d940c", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです。\n元気ですか？　ぽんぽこぽーん！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生，辛苦了。\n还好吗？咚咚锵——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0264_1002_p", "source_sha256": "25fa50cc2fb28ebedfd510398ce088276f23d19bfc7915763ce2836dccc1a21d", "ja": "ありがとう、元気だよ。\n麗花の方こそ疲れてないか？　撮影、続いてるけど。", "zh": "谢谢，我挺好的。倒是丽花，你不累吗？拍摄还在继续呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0264_1003_048rei", "source_sha256": "ad6f5169fe4cbf44f70e030f63c4db075a1c916d7539fab7d938b88581e4552e", "ja": "へっちゃらです！　休憩中に温泉に入らせて\nもらったので、体力はバッチリ満タンですよ♪", "zh": "完全没问题！　休息时泡了温泉，所以体力已经满满的啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0264_1004_048rei", "source_sha256": "ef4cc22370a5d08ffa0714a3ee5c3778fd45fa09c6dee183467e09bb65153393", "ja": "それにこの役、演じるのがすっごく楽しくて。\nタヌキに育てられた、妖術使い！", "zh": "而且，这个角色演起来特别开心。\n被狸猫养大的妖术师！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0264_1005_048rei", "source_sha256": "101dc87df00b6c6a5ad774603cce44270409093e818907d42dbff8901718cd1c", "ja": "私にピッタリですよね。\n{$P$}さんも、そう思いませんか？", "zh": "很适合我，对吧？\n{$P$}先生也这么觉得吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0264_1006_p", "source_sha256": "497137008124b88b8bb1d03e41a8afac7479fb69c3f7d04de1c3863545f3bd8c", "ja": "うん、不思議とピッタリだな。\n難しそうな役どころだと思っていたんだけど……。", "zh": "嗯，不可思议地合适呢。\n我本来还觉得是个挺有难度的角色……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0264_1007_048rei", "source_sha256": "2bf7ebf9ac5d9262323c14baac43e0771851694c9ed7d27eb6ecb076e12c8553", "ja": "えっへん！　実は私……。\nタヌキと似てるところがあるんです！", "zh": "嘿嘿！其实我……和狸猫有相似的地方！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0264_1008_048rei", "source_sha256": "e4e52d2f08be033e6f4a185203f6452bc8c71c228c6488a55062434dc467cf4e", "ja": "満月の夜になると、踊りたくなりますし……。\nお腹を叩くと、すっごくいい音がするんですよ？", "zh": "一到满月之夜，我就会想跳舞，而且……  \n敲敲肚子的话，还会发出特别好听的声音哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0264_1009_048rei", "source_sha256": "fbb57e2734b4e4fabff1a4204843ec0a8cd2ef23d34ba27fb1c693555d6f3641", "ja": "ほらほら、{$P$}さんも\n叩いてみてください！　ぽんぽこ♪", "zh": "来来，{$P$}先生也请试着敲敲看！咚咚♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0264_1010_p", "source_sha256": "7be294f3f7150a06c467710aaa78e33e86f86c1f7d7818573e9c1fcf642a6de6", "ja": "いや、それは遠慮するけど……なるほど。\nそこまで役作りをしてくれてたわけか。", "zh": "不，这就免了……原来如此。\n原来你都揣摩角色到这种地步了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0264_1011_048rei", "source_sha256": "c44689fe8bf939748bd06429e443d36baa33c73b11103a733ab2028bb1fce885", "ja": "役作り……うーん、そうかも？　なんだか、\nタヌキを家族みたいに感じちゃってるんです♪", "zh": "进入角色……嗯，或许是吧？总觉得，\n我已经把狸猫当成自己的家人了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0264_1012_048rei", "source_sha256": "13a724e3b07dae312e3e5d78f0b7b6e64ed7b892744f94823d91f442b7cc76b4", "ja": "このままだと私、本当に妖術使いに\nなっちゃうかも……？　そうしたら、どうしますか？", "zh": "照这样下去，我真的可能会变成妖术师……？那样的话，你会怎么办？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0264_1013_p", "source_sha256": "da950cd0cb474e0b7d4f1622c9d69275717179296255f7442a889178721d1325", "ja": "どう……とは？", "zh": "“什么怎么办……？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0264_1014_048rei", "source_sha256": "31cf4171ea01a20eaa2e49bf7a1beccb70bc2198970678b3aa839fbdbb39a432", "ja": "妖術使いの私は、何にでも化けられるそうなので。\nイタズラし放題ですよね？　ふふっ♪", "zh": "据说身为妖术师的我，能变成任何东西呢。\n那就可以尽情恶作剧了对吧？呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0264_1015_048rei", "source_sha256": "440a20962e619e6adfa31bf117c4713f339888d4a9106822c384329f5939770e", "ja": "{$P$}さんのことも、\nたくさん騙して、化かしちゃうかもしれませんよ！", "zh": "我可能也会骗{$P$}先生好多次，\n把你给捉弄得团团转哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0264_1016_p", "source_sha256": "4dfb68de4581f2fceda9b53474e58dfedff11a500458fab76e71cce7b49007ae", "ja": "うーん、そうだな……まあ。\n麗花に化かされるなら、別にいいかな。", "zh": "嗯——这个嘛……也对。要是被丽花骗了，好像也没什么关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0264_1017_048rei", "source_sha256": "61bba09619d1b96278fffcb5081c38636b59ab2944ce80f4ce45cef941742181", "ja": "えっ！？　いいんですか？　どうして？", "zh": "诶！？真的可以吗？为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0264_1018_p", "source_sha256": "6d7fea922b1a24394a7903fc331486273e2fbdf7b907fa113f7e8b2831523528", "ja": "麗花には、傷つけてやろうとか、\n悪い事してやろうとか、そういう考えはないだろうし。", "zh": "丽花应该没有想要伤害她，或者对她做什么坏事之类的想法吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0264_1019_p", "source_sha256": "2e7f7740d94a76662c072947d5b40248e4c270157e18260288aadc57d32b0cc4", "ja": "相手を楽しませるために、化かすんだよな？\nだったら、別にいいかなって。", "zh": "是为了让对方开心，才要骗对方的，对吧？既然这样，我觉得也没什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0264_1020_048rei", "source_sha256": "06b1f431ec0918f7546bc5a36f9fb9be819f964de967a625495fe5af2b905ee2", "ja": "おおっ、{$P$}さん、さすが！\nぴんぽーん、北上麗花クイズ、大正解～♪", "zh": "哦哦，{$P$}先生，不愧是你！\n叮咚，北上丽花问答，答对啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0264_1021_048rei", "source_sha256": "2cd237f325c2377022d6c064644ae0a6cc47f40a49f5da9f901848a1fa3cda2d", "ja": "それじゃ、楽しく化かしてあげますから……。\n映像、ちゃんと見ててください、ね？　ふふっ♪", "zh": "那就来开开心心地把你变个戏法吧……  \n要好好看着影像哦？呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
